{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24116","headline":"狂言示诸侄 · 白居易","name":"狂言示诸侄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世欺不识字，我忝攻文笔。\n世欺不得官，我忝居班秩。\n人老多病苦，我今幸无疾。\n人老多忧累，我今婚嫁毕。\n心安不移转，身泰无牵率。\n所以十年来，形神闲且逸。\n况当垂老岁，所要无多物。\n一裘煖过冬，一饭饱终日。\n勿言舍宅小，不过寝一室。\n何用鞍马多，不能骑两匹。\n如我优幸身，人中十有七。\n如我知足心，人中百无一。\n傍观愚亦见，当己贤多失。\n不敢论他人，狂言示诸侄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24116.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24116","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}